#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:25
#: 32d0a1fbd8c946769b579303c92d1668
msgid ""
"Connect the UART from the 'Customer Interface' port on the fuel cell to any "
"serial port on your autopilot.  `See device user manual "
"<https://www.intelligent-energy.com/our-products/support/>`__ for details on"
" where to find the 'Customer Interface'.  Only the GND, UART TX, and UART RX"
" connections are required.  See the diagram below:"
msgstr ""
"将燃料电池「Customer Interface」端口的 UART 连接到飞控的任意串口。`参阅设备用户手册 "
"<https://www.intelligent-energy.com/our-products/support/>`__ 了解「Customer "
"Interface」的位置。只需连接 GND、UART TX 和 UART RX。请参阅下图："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:33
#: c4f6d0c8d1074a9b92d4e89b3f2794cf
msgid "Parameter Configuration"
msgstr "参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:35
#: 175a6e13298b41c1ac2d0ac4b4b380ea
msgid ""
"Enable the fuel cell driver by setting :ref:`GEN_TYPE <GEN_TYPE>` to 1."
msgstr "将 :ref:`GEN_TYPE <GEN_TYPE>` 设置为 1 以启用燃料电池驱动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:37
#: d9339a5ba1e249a3874791cbf6783c77
msgid ""
"Fuel cell telemetry is transmitted over serial.  The appropriate serial port"
" needs to be configured to receive fuel cell data.  Set the "
":ref:`SERIALX_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` parameter to 30 for generator."
msgstr ""
"燃料电池数传通过串口传输。需要配置相应串口以接收燃料电池数据。将 :ref:`SERIALX_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` "
"参数设置为 30（发电机）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:39
#: d3ef8bf6252748cf8ef241edfc508b1c
msgid ""
"The generator library utilises the battery monitor mavlink message to "
"display fuel cell telemetry on the ground station.  Two battery monitor "
"instances are required for one fuel cell.  One for the fuel tank and another"
" for the battery.  Set :ref:`BATTX_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` parameter to 17 "
"for the fuel cells electrical data.  Set another :ref:`BATTX_MONITOR "
"<BATT_MONITOR>` parameter to 18 for the hydrogen tank telemetry."
msgstr ""
"发电机库利用电池监测 MAVLink 消息在地面站显示燃料电池数传。一个燃料电池需要两个电池监测实例：一个用于燃料罐，另一个用于电池。将 "
":ref:`BATTX_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` 参数设置为 17 以获取燃料电池电气数据；将另一个 "
":ref:`BATTX_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` 参数设置为 18 以获取氢气罐数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:41
#: 1552407f40c544758b2017e04720667b
msgid ""
"This fuel cell unit only reports battery percentage remaining and tank "
"percentage remaining.  As such, the following parameters must be set for "
"both tank and battery:"
msgstr "此燃料电池单元仅报告电池剩余百分比和罐剩余百分比。因此，必须为罐和电池设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:43
#: 982464324e064cf19c04ec0a42a81a88
msgid ""
":ref:`BATTX_CAPACITY <BATT_CAPACITY>` = 100 must be set to give a sensible "
"readout of a percentage on the GCS."
msgstr ":ref:`BATTX_CAPACITY <BATT_CAPACITY>` = 100，以在地面站获得有意义的百分比读数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:45
#: a66dff3d58a64bb48da5fbb663718661
msgid ""
"Capacity related failsafes can be set using :ref:`BATTX_LOW_MAH "
"<BATT_LOW_MAH>`, :ref:`BATTX_CRT_MAH <BATT_CRT_MAH>`, :ref:`BATTX_ARM_MAH "
"<BATT_ARM_MAH>`."
msgstr ""
"可使用 :ref:`BATTX_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>`、:ref:`BATTX_CRT_MAH "
"<BATT_CRT_MAH>`、:ref:`BATTX_ARM_MAH <BATT_ARM_MAH>` 设置与容量相关的失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:47
#: b748bc7e37a14bb98924e1f294c8eb25
msgid ""
"Reboot the autopilot after setting the parameters for the settings to take "
"effect."
msgstr "设置参数后重启飞控以使设置生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:50
#: 7fb76c8cfb1e4549b4d1d677581ce21a
msgid ""
"In this instance, ignore the units of these parameters.  The capacities are "
"only reported as a percentage.  As such values should be entered in the "
"range from 1 to 100."
msgstr "在此情况下，忽略这些参数的单位。容量仅以百分比报告，因此值应在 1 到 100 范围内输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:53
#: 02aa2ec57e774df6a3c49d99988aa158
msgid ""
"No voltage data is available for these units and a fixed voltage of 1 V is "
"always reported.  To avoid low voltage pre-arm warnings and failsafes "
":ref:`BATTX_ARM_VOLT <BATT_ARM_VOLT>` = 0, :ref:`BATTX_LOW_VOLT "
"<BATT_LOW_VOLT>` = 0, and :ref:`BATTX_CRT_VOLT <BATT_CRT_VOLT>` = 0 must be "
"set to disable voltage related failsafes on this model."
msgstr ""
"这些设备不提供电压数据，始终报告固定电压 1V。为避免低电压预解锁警告和失控保护，必须将 :ref:`BATTX_ARM_VOLT "
"<BATT_ARM_VOLT>` = 0、:ref:`BATTX_LOW_VOLT <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` = 0 和 "
":ref:`BATTX_CRT_VOLT <BATT_CRT_VOLT>` = 0 以禁用此型号的电压相关失控保护。"

