"under the 'BAT' data group.  Battery used will be displayed under 'CurrTot' "
"for the electrical instance.  Fuel used will be displayed under 'CurrTot' "
"for the fuel instance."
msgstr ""
"燃料和电池电平以已用百分比记录，记录在「BAT」数据组下。电池已用量显示在电气实例的「CurrTot」下。燃料已用量显示在燃料实例的「CurrTot」下。"

